<title>GREECE: ERGO SECURITIES UPS EQUITY CAPITAL TO 1.0BLN DRS.</title>
<headline>ERGO SECURITIES UPS EQUITY CAPITAL TO 1.0BLN DRS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ergobank subsidiary Ergo Securities, a member broker of the Athens stock exchange, raised its share capital to 1.0 billion drachmas, Ergobank said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Ergo Securities ...now satisfies the prerequisites for additional activities such as underwriting new issues headed for listing on the exchange,&quot; it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
